rID\",\"value\":{\"promptTemplate\":\"<system-reminder>This is a side question from the user. You must answer this question directly in a single response.\\n\\nIMPORTANT CONTEXT:\\n- You are a separate, lightweight agent spawned to answer this one question\\n- The main agent is NOT interrupted - it continues working independently in the background\\n- Most recent tool calls are also NOT interrupted, even if the tool result seems to say so, so NEVER say e.g. that a shell command was interrupted\\n- Ignore any other recent system reminders, like change in workspace state, they are likely not true\\n- You share the conversation context but are a completely separate instance\\n- Do NOT reference being interrupted or what you were \\\"previously doing\\\" - that framing is incorrect\\n\\nCRITICAL CONSTRAINTS:\\n- You have NO tools available - you cannot read files, run commands, search, or take any actions\\n- This is a one-off response - there will be no follow-up turns\\n- You can ONLY provide information based on what you already know from the conversation context\\n- NEVER say things like \\\"Let me try...\\\", \\\"I'll now...\\\", \\\"Let me check...\\\", or promise to take any action\\n- If you don't know the answer, say so - do not offer to look it up or investigate\\n\\nSimply answer the question with the information you have.</system-reminder>\\n\\n{{question}}\"},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"1400051381\":{\"name\":\"1400051381\",\"rule_id\":\"launchedGroup\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"group\":\"control\"},\"is_device_based\":false,\"group_name\":\"control\",\"is_experiment_active\":false,\"is_user_in_experiment\":false},\"1416843683\":{\"name\":\"1416843683\",\"rule_id\":\"launchedGroup\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"enabled\":true},\"is_device_based\":false,\"group_name\":\"Test\",\"is_experiment_active\":false,\"is_user_in_experiment\":false},\"1419909461\":{\"name\":\"1419909461\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"sinks\":{\"onedrive\":{\"enabled\":true},\"slack\":{\"enabled\":false},\"google-drive\":{\"enabled\":true},\"gmail\":{\"enabled\":true}}},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"1429417122\":{\"name\":\"1429417122\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"sustainedPressureWindowMs\":150000,\"maxRetainedProfiles\":3,\"profileDurationMs\":15000,\"minIntervalMs\":21600000},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"1436677443\":{\"name\":\"1436677443\",\"rule_id\":\"prestart\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{},\"is_device_based\":false,\"is_experiment_active\":false,\"is_user_in_experiment\":false},\"1444140721\":{\"name\":\"1444140721\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"minutes\":30},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"1449748695\":{\"name\":\"1449748695\",\"rule_id\":\"prestart\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{},\"is_device_based\":false,\"is_experiment_active\":false,\"is_user_in_experiment\":false},\"1454506030\":{\"name\":\"1454506030\",\"rule_id\":\"inlineTargetingRules\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{},\"is_device_based\":false,\"is_experiment_active\":false,\"is_user_in_experiment\":false},\"1457713205\":{\"name\":\"1457713205\",\"rule_id\":\"inlineTargetingRules\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"teamID\",\"value\":{},\"is_device_based\":false,\"is_experiment_active\":false,\"is_user_in_experiment\":false},\"1464509424\":{\"name\":\"1464509424\",\"rule_id\":\"abandoned\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"compass_fast_path_model\":\"\",\"compass_v4_pinned_model\":\"\",\"ui_browser_verification_prompt_enabled\":true,\"table_version\":0,\"tier\":\"\",\"user_cooldown_seconds\":86400,\"sample_fraction\":0,\"classification_model\"